  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 9.009,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now I, Moroni, after having made an end of abridging the account of the people of Jared, I had supposed not to have written more,",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 9.189,
      "end": 11.511,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but I have not as yet perished;",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 11.691,
      "end": 16.103,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I make not myself known to the Lamanites lest they should destroy me.",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 16.783,
      "end": 20.545,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, their wars are exceedingly fierce among themselves;",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 20.725,
      "end": 25.555,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and because of their hatred they put to death every Nephite that will not deny the Christ.",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 26.235,
      "end": 28.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I, Moroni, will not deny the Christ;",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 28.876,
      "end": 31.802,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, I wander whithersoever",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 31.982,
      "end": 34.443,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I can for the safety of mine own life.",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 35.123,
      "end": 40.046,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, I write a few more things, contrary to that which I had supposed;",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 40.226,
      "end": 43.802,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I had supposed not to have written any more;",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 43.982,
      "end": 54.477,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but I write a few more things, that perhaps they may be of worth unto my brethren, the Lamanites, in some future day, according to the will of the Lord.",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    }
  ]
}